+<!-- AgentDash: live-event-revocation — DO NOT REMOVE OR REORDER THIS BLOCK -->
+## Live event access can be revoked
+
+If you subscribe to \`GET /api/companies/:companyId/events/ws\`, access is rechecked before event delivery and on each heartbeat. A WebSocket close with code \`1008\` means access is no longer valid or could not be verified. Stop reconnecting with that credential; obtain current company access or a replacement key from the authorized human before resubscribing. Never use another company's key or an anonymous connection to bypass the refusal. Report the interruption in a task comment when your remaining access permits it.
+<!-- /AgentDash: live-event-revocation -->
